Generic synopsis.
Peniophora subg. Gloeopeniophora. Fruitbodies more or less orange.
Hyphal texture not brown.
1. P. incarnata-group. P. aurantiaca, erikssonii, incarnata, laeta, laurentii.
Peniophora subg. Peniophora. Fruitbodies reddish-grey-violaceousbrown.
Hyphal texture at least partly brown.
1. P. cinerea-group. Encrusted metuloid cystidia, sulfocystidia present
or not, no dendrohyphidia. P. cinerea, junipericola, limita ta, nuda,
piceae, pini, pithya, quercina, ru/a, ru/omarginata, septentrionalis,
suecica, violaceolivida.
2. P. lycii-group. With or without encrusted cystidia; sulfocystidia and
dendrohyphidia present. P. lilacea, lycii, polygonia.